name issue_12_lossbwe_random_loss
describe 5% random loss on a 2 Mbps link with 40 ms one-way delay: the loss-based estimate must not pin the target (#6, #12)
# LossBasedBweV2 (cc v2) tells inherent loss (noise at any rate) from loss caused by the sending rate.
# 5 seeds (cc v2): utilization 75.7-82.1 %, video 1311-1420 kbps, no freezes. `cc v1`: 35-53 %. libwebrtc (CI compare-webrtc, random_loss_5pct): 76 %, 1355 kbps.
duration 30s
at 0s capacity=2000kbps delay=40ms jitter=3ms loss=5% queue=300ms
# PR for #375 (Opus size model calibrated to libopus; the start probe moves; program.md 0.2, needs-human): was >= 70. Ours 69.84 on seed 1;
# libwebrtc 68.07 on seed 1, worst of seeds 1-10 67.29 (mean 71.9), on #324's compare-webrtc. Owner (PR #382): the allowed margin,
# capped at libwebrtc's worst seed.
expect cc.utilization_pct >= 67.3
# Was < 200. Guard rail during a port (program.md 0.2, needs-human, #217): with the packet history's RTT as
# ModuleRtpRtcpImpl2 keeps it and the receiver's NACK RTT from CallStats (video/call_stats2.cc), seed 1 freezes
# 208 ms; with the RTCP report interval from the sender's whole send rate (RtpSenderEgress::GetSendRates(now).Sum())
# it was 474 ms (10 seeds: mean 409, libwebrtc 415); with early loss detection (RtpVideoSender::OnPacketFeedbackVector)
# it is 223 ms (10 seeds of random_loss_5pct: mean 287). libwebrtc fails < 200 on 8 of 10 seeds (random_loss_5pct,
# parity-data: 613 411 427 0 310 193 462 1028 708 0, mean 415). Bound per the Owner rule on PR #216: just above our
# seed-1 value, never above libwebrtc's worst seed (1028).
# With #224/#204's flip (`send_rate_stats` + `control_handler`), ours seed 1 447 (seeds 1-10: 447 534 464 870 235 752
# 0 718 441 0, mean 446; main 287, libwebrtc 415). Moved by the same rule.
# PR #324 (#84's flip, quality scaling on): was < 460. Provisional lock, tracked to #376 (Owner option A, 2026-10-24): ours 1313 on seed 1, libwebrtc worst seed 1-10 769 (mean 472).
expect video.freeze_total_ms < 1450
expect audio.concealed_pct < 3
expect audio.interruptions == 0
